# Google OAuth — Desktop ("installed") client for Windows loopback PKCE flow
# Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials → OAuth 2.0 Client → Desktop app
# Download JSON key is "installed" (not "web").
#
# REQUIRED after clone (`.env` is gitignored — secrets are never pushed):
#   1) cp .env.example .env
#   2) Paste Client secret below from Google Cloud Desktop OAuth client
# Without FIREBASE_GOOGLE_DESKTOP_CLIENT_SECRET, Windows "Войти через Google" is disabled.
FIREBASE_GOOGLE_DESKTOP_CLIENT_ID=911773858551-bbjtglnabr6hcakovna9qbvm9c0tegr9.apps.googleusercontent.com
FIREBASE_GOOGLE_DESKTOP_CLIENT_SECRET=

